# Mary M. Muraguri — Portfolio & Interactive Resume

A responsive single-page web portfolio and interactive Resume/CV built with **Tailwind CSS**, **Alpine.js** and **Lucide Icons**. This platform presents professional experience, career roadmaps, technical skills, certifications and operational projects.

---

## 🌟 Key Features

* **Interactive Credentials Preview**: Switch between a concise **Professional Resume** and a **Comprehensive CV** modal with built-in printing support.
* **Dynamic Dark / Light Mode**: Theme toggle featuring automatic system preference detection and `localStorage` state retention.
* **Responsive Navigation**: Mobile menu drawer with smooth scrolling across all site sections.
* **Project Showcase**: Horizontal scrolling slider highlighting administrative modernization initiatives and key projects.
* **Structured Timelines**: Responsive grid timelines organizing work experience, ongoing professional development and affiliations.
* **SEO & Social Sharing Ready**: Configured with JSON-LD structured data (`Person`), social media cards and metadata for search indexing.

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack & Dependencies

| Tool / Library | Role | Source |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **HTML5 & CSS3** | Web page structure and foundational styles | Native Browser Support |
| **Tailwind CSS** | On-the-fly utility styling | CDN (`cdn.tailwindcss.com`) |
| **Alpine.js** | Interactive state management for modal and tabs | CDN (`cdn.jsdelivr.net`) |
| **Lucide Icons** | Interface vector icons | CDN (`[unpkg.com/lucide](https://unpkg.com/lucide)`) |

---

